abstract: >-
  3we is an AI-First open-source robot platform for Embodied AI research.
  The same Python code runs identically in Gazebo simulation, NVIDIA Isaac Sim,
  and on real hardware (Raspberry Pi 5 + Hailo-8L + ESP32-S3) with zero code
  changes. The platform provides a 5-line Python API, Gymnasium-compatible
  environments, VLM/VLA integration, trajectory recording, and standardized
  benchmarks — all on open hardware costing under $500 to reproduce.
